--- body ---
## Context
experiments/outputs/ mixed primary table experiments, derived analyses, and
non-table experiments. This made extraction/evaluation brittle (must exclude
dirs) and unclear (is a missing CSV a bug or by design?).

## Design (chosen: three-way split)

```
experiments/
  outputs/              table experiments only
    census/  decomposed/  frontier/  multiturn/  rag/  sourced/  web/

  derived/              cross-run analyses, computed from outputs/
    rag_consistency/      consolidated/union CSVs, summary JSON
    verification/         tool-verified & filtered CSVs

  qualitative/          non-table experiments (raw replies, no extraction)
    scenarios/            .json  .md
    skill_plans/          .json  .md
```

## Exit criteria
- outputs/ contains only table experiments with uniform .json/.csv/.eval.json
- derived/ and qualitative/ populated with moved content
- _extracted/ removed (was duplicate of rag/ CSVs)
- Makefile extract/evaluate targets work without exclude lists
- READMEs document each directory's purpose and provenance
